## 5. Not checked

The honest list. Each entry: what is unverified, and either what would be needed to verify it or why
this project has decided not to.

<!-- DECIDE: work through the criteria this project's applicable standard names, and put every one
     that is not in §3 or §4 here. Known-hard-to-automate ones belong here almost always — reading
